Link a PR to this thread. T3 shows its status and settles the thread on merge. For several PRs, use `link_pull_requests`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__t3_code__link_pull_request(args: {
  environmentId?: string;
  host?: string;
  // With `repository`, when no `url`.
  number?: number;
  repository?: string;
  threadId?: string;
  url?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ alreadyLinked: boolean; host: string; next?: string | null; number: number; repository: string; url: string; [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };
```

Write review guides for up to 20 PRs (the tour in the PR Guide tab). Returns once runs start. Each run takes minutes in a temporary checkout. A run for the same head is joined. Read with `read_pull_request_guide`. Fails while guides are off.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__t3_code__write_pull_request_guides(args: { environmentId?: string; pullRequests: Array<{
  host?: string;
  // With `repository`, when no `url`.
  number?: number;
  repository?: string;
  url?: string;
}>; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ guides: Array<{
  detail: string | null;
  host: string;
  number: number;
  // started: a run began. running: joined a run for this head. failed: see detail.
  outcome: "started" | "running" | "failed";
  repository: string;
  url: string;
  [key: string]: unknown;
}>; [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };
```
